      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done -- two outputs per iteration, loading 4 new rows and running the window-shift once instead of twice. The loop\u0027s iteration count is odd when height % 4 \u003d\u003d 2, so there\u0027s a single-output remainder iteration to keep the window in sync with the bottom-edge epilogue in that case; verified bit-exact across every height % 4 residue with a standalone adversarial harness in addition to the gtest sweep.",
