      "writtenOn": "2026-08-20T14:11:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done — the three outer taps now combine in a single 16-bit accumulator (max magnitude 6120, well inside int16_t), with the -1 tap as a plain vsubq_s16 instead of a multiply. The centre tap\u0027s own product also fits in 16-bit (56*510\u003d28560), but combined with the outer partial the total can reach 34680, so that combine still needs the 32-bit widen (vmlal_lane_s16 + vaddw_s16) -- verified the exact overflow bounds by hand and re-checked with an adversarial bit-exact sweep (all-0/all-255/checkerboard/ramp patterns across every code path) on real Neoverse N1 hardware.",
